      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Presa. Axew vive em ninhos escavados no solo. Povos antigos usavam suas presas como facas de cozinha. Marcas de dentes incomuns em pedras ou árvores indicam que um deles provavelmente vive por perto.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Axew pode evoluir para Fraxure no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bite, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Assurance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Dragon Rage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Dual Chop</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Crunch, False Swipe</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Breaking Swipe, Dragon Claw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dragon Dance, Focus Energy, Laser Focus</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Dragon Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Guillotine, Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Outrage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Giga Impact</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Aqua Tail, Assurance, Attract, Breaking Swipe, Brick Break, Bulldoze, Confide, Crunch, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Draco Meteor, Dragon Cheer, Dragon Claw, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Dual Chop, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fling, Frustration, Giga Impact, Hidden Power, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Outrage, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Reversal, Roar, Rock Tomb, Round, Scale Shot, Scary Face, Shadow Claw, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snore, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, X-Scissor</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Counter, Dragon Pulse, Endeavor, Endure, First Impression, Focus Energy, Harden, Iron Tail, Night Slash, Razor Wind, Reversal</p>",
